function setWordDeck(deck){wordDeck=['general','slang','phrase'].includes(deck)?deck:'general';wordTopic='';phraseQuery='';wordScope='all';wordQuery='';wordPos='';wordCategory='';wordFrequency='';wordCurrent=null;wordTrail=[];wordSession=null;wordPage=0;render();window.scrollTo(0,0)}
function wordDeckSwitcher(){return `<div class="x-seg" role="tablist" aria-label="単語帳の種類">${[['general','一般の単語'],['slang','口語・スラング'],['phrase','フレーズ']].map(([d,t])=>`<button role="tab" aria-selected="${wordDeck===d}" onclick="setWordDeck('${d}')">${t}</button>`).join('')}</div>${wordDeck==='slang'?'<p class="x-note">一般の単語とは分けて出題します。口語・粗さは各項目に表示します。</p>':wordDeck==='phrase'?'<p class="x-note">あいさつ・相づち・質問・決まり文句など、そのまま使える言い回しです。</p>':''}`}
const wordInLevel=w=>w.collection==='slang'||wordDeck==='phrase'||!wordState.level||w.studyRank<=wordState.level;
function setWordLevel(n){if(![0,...WORD_LEVELS.map(([n])=>n)].includes(n))return;wordState.level=n;saveWords();wordCurrent=null;wordTrail=[];wordSession=null;wordPage=0;render()}
function levelName(){const l=WORD_LEVELS.find(([n])=>n===wordState.level);return l?l[1]+l[0].toLocaleString()+'語':'すべて'}
function wordLevelPicker(){if(wordDeck!=='general')return '';const count=bank.filter(w=>wordInDeck(w,'general')).length;return `<div class="x-control x-levels"><span class="x-label" id="x-level-label">範囲</span><div class="x-chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="x-level-label">${[...WORD_LEVELS,[0,'全部']].map(([n,name])=>`<button aria-pressed="${wordState.level===n}" onclick="setWordLevel(${n})"><span>${name}</span><b>${(n||count).toLocaleString()}<small>語</small></b></button>`).join('')}</div></div>`}
function normalizeKana(value){return String(value).normalize('NFKC').replace(/[ぁ-ゖ]/g,c=>String.fromCharCode(c.charCodeAt(0)+0x60)).replace(/ング/g,'ン').replace(/[ァィゥェォャュョ]/g,c=>({'ァ':'ア','ィ':'イ','ゥ':'ウ','ェ':'エ','ォ':'オ','ャ':'ヤ','ュ':'ユ','ョ':'ヨ'})[c]).replace(/[ッー・\s.、\-]/g,'').replace(/[ガギグゲゴザジズゼゾダヂヅデドバビブベボパピプペポ]/g,c=>({'ガ':'カ','ギ':'キ','グ':'ク','ゲ':'ケ','ゴ':'コ','ザ':'サ','ジ':'チ','ズ':'ス','ゼ':'セ','ゾ':'ソ','ダ':'タ','ヂ':'チ','ヅ':'ツ','デ':'テ','ド':'ト','バ':'ハ','ビ':'ヒ','ブ':'フ','ベ':'ヘ','ボ':'ホ','パ':'ハ','ピ':'ヒ','プ':'フ','ペ':'ヘ','ポ':'ホ'})[c])}
